OL,5,G0900 Cruising with Jane McDonald
OL,6,     FJane voyages around Iceland. From
OL,7,     FReykjavik, she boards the former
OL,8,     Fferry Ocean Diamond for a voyage
OL,9,     Faround Iceland's rugged
OL,10,     Fshorelines, where highlights
OL,11,     Finclude the aurora borealis.
OL,12,G1000 Dogs Behaving (Very) Badly
OL,13,     FIn Graeme Hall's first case he
OL,14,     Fturns marriage counsellor to break
OL,15,     Fup a furry love triangle. And at a
OL,16,     Fretirement home for rescue dogs, a
OL,17,     Fresident Romanian bites the hand
OL,18,     Fthat feeds him.
